        "width": 600,
        "height": 280
      },
      "note": "## Save space\n\nMakes video files smaller by re-encoding the video to **HEVC** (H.265). Most files shrink by a third or more without a visible difference. Audio and subtitles are copied as they are.\n\n1. Try a **Dry run** on a few files first: it shows what would change and writes nothing.\n2. Want smaller files? Raise **Quality (CRF)** on Encode video. Lower numbers look better and take more space.\n3. A file that doesn't get at least **15 %** smaller keeps its original."
    },
